-bottom, 0px) + 84px);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n    min-height: 100vh;\n  }\n  /* 顶部导航 */\n  .top-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 4px 16px 12px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .btn-back-arrow {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 14px;\n    background: transparent;\n    border: none;\n    color: #bbb;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    padding: 4px 8px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .ph-logo {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  }\n  .ph-logo .white { color: #ffffff; margin-right: 3px; }\n  .ph-logo .badge {\n    background: #ffa31a;\n    color: #000;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n\n  /* 视频列表容器 */\n  .video-feed {\n    padding: 0 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n  .video-card {\n    background: #141414;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    position: relative;\n    border: 1px solid #202020;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n  }\n  .card-poster {\n    width: 100%;\n    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #262626 0%, #101010 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .card-poster-avatar {\n    width: 72px;\n    height: 72px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(255,163,26,0.6);\n    opacity: 0.85;\n  }\n  .tag-overlay {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    left: 8px;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,163,26,0.3);\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 2px 6px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n  }\n  .btn-delete-card {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 8px;\n    right: 8px;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 26px;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);\n    color: #aaa;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .btn-delete-card:active { color: #fff; background: rgba(255,50,50,0.7); }\n  .play-circle {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #ffa31a;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding-left: 3px;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255,163,26,0.35);\n  }\n  .duration-badge {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    right: 8px;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);\n    color: #fff;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 2px 5px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n  }\n  .card-info {\n    padding: 10px 12px 12px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .card-title {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin-bottom: 7px;\n    display: -webkit-box;\n    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;\n    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .card-meta {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n  }\n  .card-actor {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    color: #bbb;\n  }\n  .card-actor-img {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    background: #333;\n  }\n\n  /* 适合 PH 的开局空白页引导 */\n  .ph-empty-hero {\n    border: 1px dashed #262626;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 40px 18px;\n    text-align: center;\n    background: #111111;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n  }\n  .ph-empty-icon { font-size: 38px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .ph-empty-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; color: #ffa31a; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .ph-empty-sub { color: #777; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; }\n\n  /* 悬浮底部触发按钮 */\n  .bottom-bar {\n    position: fixed;\n    bottom: calc(var(--nuo-safe-bottom, 0px) + 14px);\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    z-index: 100;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .btn-new-video {\n    pointer-events: auto;\n    background: #ffa31a;\n    color: #000;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 30px;\n    padding: 12px 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(255,163,26,0.5);\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .btn-new-video:active { transform: scale(0.97); opacity: 0.95; }\n\n  /* 抽屉与全屏详情 */\n  .drawer-mask {\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.82);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\n    z-index: 200;\n    display: none;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n  }\n  .drawer-mask.open { display: flex; }\n  .drawer-panel {\n    background: #121212;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-height: 90vh;\n    border-radius: 18px 18px 0 0;\n    padding: 18px 16px calc(var(--nuo-safe-bottom, 0px) + 20px);\n    overflow-y: auto;\n    border-top: 1px solid #282828;\n    animation: slideUp 0.22s ease-out;\n  }\n  @keyframes slideUp {\n    from { transform: translateY(100%); }\n    to { transform: translateY(0); }\n  }\n  .drawer-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    position: sticky;\n    top: -18px;\n    background: #121212;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    z-index: 10;\n  }\n  .drawer-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .drawer-close {\n    background: #202020;\n    border: none;\n    color: #aaa;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  /* 表单控件 */\n  .form-group { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .form-label {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .form-subhint {\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .input-box, .select-box {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #1c1c1c;\n    border: 1px solid #2b2b2b;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    outline: none;\n  }\n  .input-box::placeholder { color: #555; font-size: 13px; }\n  .input-box:focus, .select-box:focus { border-color: #ffa31a; }\n  .tag-selector {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n  .quick-chip {\n    background: #1f1f1f;\n    color: #999;\n    border: 1px solid #2d2d2d;\n    padding: 4px 9px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .quick-chip:active {\n    background: #2a2012;\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    border-color: #ffa31a;\n  }\n  .btn-submit-action {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: #ffa31a;\n    color: #000;\n    border: none;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    padding: 13px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .btn-submit-action:disabled { opacity: 0.5; }\n\n  /* 报错横幅 */\n  .error-banner {\n    display: none;\n    background: #381010;\n    border: 1px solid #ff4d4f;\n    color: #ffb4b4;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    margin-top: 12px;\n    word-break: break-all;\n    white-space: pre-wrap;\n  }\n\n  /* 截图同款 PH 视频详情页面排版 */\n  .ph-detail-wrapper {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .ph-auth-badge {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .ph-pill-tag {\n    background: #ffa31a;\n    color: #000;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 2px 7px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .ph-pill-sub {\n    color: #ffa31a;\n  }\n  .ph-detail-title {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .ph-detail-stats {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 12px;\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .ph-tag-chips {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .ph-tag-item {\n    background: #1e1e1e;\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 3px 8px;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* 作者卡片 */\n  .ph-creator-card {\n    background: #181818;\n    border: 1px solid #222;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .ph-creator-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .ph-creator-avatar {\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    background: #2a2a2a;\n    border: 1.5px solid #ffa31a;\n  }\n  .ph-creator-name {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .ph-creator-handle {\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #777;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .ph-subscribed-badge {\n    background: #252525;\n    color: #888;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  /* 描述与时间轴 */\n  .ph-description-block {\n    background: #161616;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 14px 12px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #d8d8d8;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    border: 1px solid #222;\n  }\n  .ph-warning-title {\n    color: #888;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 14px 0 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n  .ph-timeline-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .ph-timeline-item {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: #ececec;\n  }\n  .ph-timestamp {\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n  }\n\n  /* 热评区 TOP 3 */\n  .ph-comment-section {\n    border-top: 1px solid #242424;\n    padding-top: 14px;\n  }\n  .ph-comment-header {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #777;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  }\n  .ph-comment-card {\n    background: #161616;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 10px 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    border: 1px solid #1f1f1f;\n  }\n  .ph-comment-user {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: #999;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    margin-bottom: 5px;\n  }\n  .ph-comment-text {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    color: #ddd;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .ph-comment-like {\n    color: #ffa31a;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <!-- 顶栏 -->\n  <header class=\"top-header\">\n    <button class=\"btn-back-arrow\" onclick=\"if(window.Nuojiji)Nuojiji.close()\">‹</button>\n    <div class=\"ph-logo\">\n      <span class=\"white\">PORN</span>\n      <span class=\"badge\">HUB</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- 视频列表 -->\n  <main class=\"video-feed\" id=\"video-feed\">\n    <div class=\"ph-empty-hero\">\n      <div class=\"ph-empty-icon\">🎬</div>\n      <div class=\"ph-empty-title\">Pornhub 独家私房纪实</div>\n      <div class=\"ph-empty-sub\">暂无任何存档片目。<br>点击下方「拍一部新片」开启策划，全程不写入主聊天记忆。</div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- 吸底操作按钮 -->\n  <div class=\"bottom-bar\">\n    <button class=\"btn-new-video\" onclick=\"openDrawer()\">\n      <span>📹</span> 拍一部新片\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 策划新片 模态抽屉 -->\n  <div class=\"drawer-mask\" id=\"drawer-mask\">\n    <div class=\"drawer-panel\">\n      <div class=\"drawer-header\">\n        <div class=\"drawer-title\">📹 策划新片记录</div>\n        <button class=\"drawer-close\" onclick=\"closeDrawer()\">✕</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 线下提示词预设 -->\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-label\">线下提示词预设</div>\n        <select id=\"preset-select\" class=\"select-box\" onchange=\"onPresetChange()\">\n          <option value=\"default\">This sky1.0——by我是树 (当前激活)</option>\n        </select>\n        <div class=\"form-subhint\" id=\"preset-subhint\">⚡ 已关联线下预设（自动注入线下规则）</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 主演角色 (选自主名册) -->\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-label\">主演角色 (选自主名册)</div>\n        <select id=\"char-select\" class=\"select-box\" onchange=\"onCharChange()\">\n          <option value=\"\">加载名册中...</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"char-name-preview\" class=\"input-box\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\" readonly>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 挂载世界书设定 -->\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-label\">\n          <span>挂载世界书设定</span>\n          <span style=\"color:#ffa31a; cursor:pointer;\" onclick=\"toggleWorldbookSelect()\">📚 资料</span>\n        </div>\n        <select id=\"wb-select\" class=\"select-box\" style=\"display:none; margin-bottom:6px;\" onchange=\"onWorldbookPicked()\">\n          <option value=\"\">选择世界书条目...</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"wb-input\" class=\"input-box\" placeholder=\"点击右侧【资料】按纽选择要挂载的世界书\">\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 体位分工 (插入方 / 承受方) -->\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-label\">体位分工 (插入方 / 承受方)</div>\n        <select id=\"pose-select\" class=\"select-box\">\n          <option value=\"user_top\">用户插入 / 角色承受 (用户主导掌控，聚焦角色失神)</option>\n          <option value=\"char_top\">角色主导 / 用户承受 (角色强攻侵略，沉沦反差)</option>\n          <option value=\"mutual\">两情相悦 / 互吻缠绵 (温柔交融，耳语低喃)</option>\n        </select>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 剧情主题 -->\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-label\">剧情主题</div>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"theme-input\" class=\"input-box\" placeholder=\"如：两情相悦、反差情趣、耳边低语、私密特写\">\n        <div class=\"tag-selector\">\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('theme-input', '两情相悦')\">两情相悦</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('theme-input', '反差情趣')\">反差情趣</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('theme-input', '耳边情话')\">耳边情话</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('theme-input', '失神抽搐')\">失神抽搐</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('theme-input', '镜前特写')\">镜前特写</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 场景环境 -->\n      <div class=\"form-group\">\n        <div class=\"form-label\">场景环境</div>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"scene-input\" class=\"input-box\" placeholder=\"如：书房、监控视角、透明浴室、私人车库\">\n        <div class=\"tag-selector\">\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('scene-input', '私人书房')\">私人书房</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('scene-input', '监控视角')\">监控视角</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('scene-input', '落地窗前')\">落地窗前</span>\n          <span class=\"quick-chip\" onclick=\"addChip('scene-input', '隔音浴室')\">隔音浴室</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <button id=\"btn-submit\" class=\"btn-submit-action\" onclick=\"generateNewVideo()\">立即生成新片</button>\n      <div id=\"error-box\" class=\"error-banner\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 详情弹窗 (截图同款) -->\n  <div class=\"drawer-mask\" id=\"detail-mask\">\n    <div class=\"drawer-panel\" id=\"detail-content\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n<script>\nlet rosterList = [];\nlet rosterProfileMap = {};\nlet worldbookList = [];\nlet videoStorage = [];\n\n// 初始加载存储列表（开局干净，无示例）\nfunction loadVideos() {\n  try {\n    const raw = localStorage.getItem('ph_videos_v3');\n    if (raw) videoStorage = JSON.parse(raw);\n  } catch (e) {\n    videoStorage = [];\n  }\n  if (!videoStorage) videoStorage = [];\n  renderVideoFeed();\n}\n\nfunction saveVideos() {\n  try {\n    localStorage.setItem('ph_videos_v3', JSON.stringify(videoStorage));\n  } catch (e) {}\n}\n\nfunction renderVideoFeed() {\n  const container = document.getElementById('video-feed');\n  if (!videoStorage || videoStorage.length === 0) {\n    container.innerHTML = `\n      <div class=\"ph-empty-hero\">\n        <div class=\"ph-empty-icon\">🎬</div>\n        <div class=\"ph-empty-title\">Pornhub 独家私房纪实</div>\n        <div class=\"ph-empty-sub\">片单暂空，所有拍摄均不会计入主聊天记忆。<br>点击下方「拍一部新片」开启策划。</div>\n      </div>\n    `;\n    return;\n  }\n\n  container.innerHTML = videoStorage.map((v, idx) => {\n    const avatarImg = v.actorAvatar \n      ? `<img class=\"card-poster-avatar\" src=\"${v.actorAvatar}\" alt=\"avatar\">` \n      : `<div class=\"card-poster-avatar\" style=\"background:#222; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:24px; color:#ffa31a;\">★</div>`;\n    const miniAvatar = v.actorAvatar\n      ? `<img class=\"card-actor-img\" src=\"${v.actorAvatar}\">`\n      : `<span style=\"color:#ffa31a;\">●</span>`;\n\n    return `\n      <div class=\"video-card\">\n        <div class=\"card-poster\" onclick=\"viewDetail(${idx})\">\n          ${avatarImg}\n          <div class=\"tag-overlay\">${v.tag || 'Pornhub'}</div>\n          <button class=\"btn-delete-card\" title=\"删除记录\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation(); deleteVideo(${idx})\">✕</button>\n          <div class=\"play-circle\">▶</div>\n          <div class=\"duration-badge\">${v.duration || '35:20'}</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card-info\" onclick=\"viewDetail(${idx})\">\n          <div class=\"card-title\">${v.title || '私密纪实片段'}</div>\n          <div class=\"card-meta\">\n            <div class=\"card-actor\">\n              ${miniAvatar}\n              <span>${v.actor || '主演'}</span>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <span>👁 ${v.views || '1.8M'}</span>\n              <span style=\"margin: 0 4px;\">·</span>\n              <span>👍 ${v.rating || '96%'}</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    `;\n  }).join('');\n}\n\nfunction deleteVideo(idx) {\n  if (confirm('确认删除本条视频动态记录？（不影响角色的实际聊天记忆）')) {\n    videoStorage.splice(idx, 1);\n    saveVideos();\n    renderVideoFeed();\n  }\n}\n\n// 截图同款 PH 视频详情页面\nfunction viewDetail(idx) {\n  const v = videoStorage[idx];\n  if (!v) return;\n\n  const tagsList = (v.tags && v.tags.length > 0) ? v.tags : ['#私房', '#直白动作','#沉沦'];\n  const tagsHtml = tagsList.map(t => `<span class=\"ph-tag-item\">${t.startsWith('#') ? t : '#' + t}</span>`).join('');\n\n  // 8 到 12 条时间轴节点\n  const tlList = v.timeline || [];\n  const tlHtml = tlList.map(item => `\n    <div class=\"ph-timeline-item\">\n      <span class=\"ph-timestamp\">▶ ${item.time}</span>\n      <span>${item.desc}</span>\n    </div>\n  `).join('');\n\n  // 热评 TOP 3\n  const commentsList = (v.comments && v.comments.length > 0) ? v.comments.slice(0, 3) : [\n    { user: 'Alpha_Lover', time: '2 hours ago', text: '这个第一人称视角太真实了，耳边喘息细节绝了。', likes: '4.8K' },\n    { user: 'VIP_Connoisseur', time: '3 hours ago', text: '镜前完全失神那一块我反复看了好几遍。', likes: '3.6K' },\n    { user: 'MidnightWatcher', time: '5 hours ago', text: '这种反差彻底击中xp，跪求出第二部！', likes: '2.1K' }\n  ];\n\n  const commentsHtml = commentsList.map(c => `\n    <div class=\"ph-comment-card\">\n      <div class=\"ph-comment-user\">\n        <span>${c.user}</span>\n        <span style=\"font-weight:normal; color:#666;\">${c.time || '1 hour ago'}</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ph-comment-text\">${c.text}</div>\n      <div class=\"ph-comment-like\">👍 ${c.likes || '2.3K'}</div>\n    </div>\n  `).join('');\n\n  const avatarTag = v.actorAvatar\n    ? `<img class=\"ph-creator-avatar\" src=\"${v.actorAvatar}\">`\n    : `<div class=\"ph-creator-avatar\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#ffa31a;font-weight:bold;\">${(v.actor || 'P').slice(0,1)}</div>`;\n\n  document.getElementById('detail-content').innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"drawer-header\">\n      <div class=\"drawer-title\">\n        <span style=\"color:#ffa31a;\">PORN</span><span>HUB</span> 独家录像\n      </div>\n      <button class=\"drawer-close\" onclick=\"closeDetail()\">✕</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ph-detail-wrapper\">\n      <!-- 认证标签 -->\n      <div class=\"ph-auth-badge\">\n        <span class=\"ph-pill-tag\">Pornhub</span>\n        <span class=\"ph-pill-sub\">Community · Verified Amateur</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 主标题 -->\n      <div class=\"ph-detail-title\">${v.title}</div>\n\n      <!-- 数据与时长 -->\n      <div class=\"ph-detail-stats\">\n        <span>👁 ${v.views || '2.8M views'}</span>\n        <span>👍 ${v.rating || '95%'}</span>\n        <span>📅 ${v.date || '刚刚拍摄'}</span>\n        <span>⏱ ${v.duration || '38:15'}</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 标签 Pills -->\n      <div class=\"ph-tag-chips\">${tagsHtml}</div>\n\n      <!-- 作者/角色卡片 -->\n      <div class=\"ph-creator-card\">\n        <div class=\"ph-creator-left\">\n          ${avatarTag}\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"ph-creator-name\">\n              <span>${v.actor}</span>\n              <span style=\"color:#ffa31a; font-size:12px;\">✓</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"ph-creator-handle\">@${v.actorHandle || 'private_channel'} · 已订阅</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"ph-subscribed-badge\">已订阅</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 简介文案与时间轴容器 -->\n      <div class=\"ph-description-block\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom:14px; white-space:pre-wrap;\">${v.intro || ''}</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"ph-warning-title\">\n          <span style=\"color:#ffa31a;\">▶</span> 高能预警：\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"ph-timeline-list\">\n          ${tlHtml}\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"margin-top:14px; border-top:1px solid #222; padding-top:12px; color:#aaa; font-size:12px; line-height:1.55;\">\n          ${v.outro || ''}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- 评论区 TOP 3 -->\n      <div class=\"ph-comment-section\">\n        <div class=\"ph-comment-header\">热评 TOP 3</div>\n        ${commentsHtml}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  `;\n  document.getElementById('detail-mask').classList.add('open');\n}\n\nfunction closeDetail() {\n  document.getElementById('detail-mask').classList.remove('open');\n}\n\n// 抽屉开关\nfunction openDrawer() {\n  document.getElementById('drawer-mask').classList.add('open');\n}\nfunction closeDrawer() {\n  document.getElementById('drawer-mask').classList.remove('open');\n}\n\n// 标签添加\nfunction addChip(inputId, text) {\n  const input = document.getElementById(inputId);\n  if (input.value) {\n    if (!input.value.includes(text)) input.value += '、' + text;\n  } else {\n    input.value = text;\n  }\n}\n\n// 数据加载与初始化\nasync function initData() {\n  const charSel = document.getElementById('char-select');\n  const preview = document.getElementById('char-name-preview');\n\n  // 1. 读取名册列表和角色头像\n  try {\n    if (window.nuo && window.nuo.roster && window.nuo.roster.list) {\n      rosterList = await window.nuo.roster.list();\n    } else if (window.Nuojiji && window.Nuojiji.getCharList) {\n      rosterList = await window.Nuojiji.getCharList();\n    }\n  } catch (e) {}\n\n  charSel.innerHTML = '';\n  if (rosterList && rosterList.length > 0) {\n    for (const c of rosterList) {\n      const opt = document.createElement('option');\n      opt.value = c.id;\n      opt.textContent = c.name || c.id;\n      charSel.appendChild(opt);\n\n      // 读取单个角色人设与头像\n      if (window.nuo && window.nuo.roster && window.nuo.roster.profile) {\n        try {\n          const prof = await window.nuo.roster.profile(c.id);\n          rosterProfileMap[c.id] = prof;\n        } catch (e) {}\n      }\n    }\n    preview.value = rosterList[0].name || rosterList[0].id;\n  } else {\n    charSel.innerHTML = '<option value=\"default_char\">软糯糯</option>';\n    preview.value = '软糯糯';\n  }\n\n  // 2. 读取线下提示词预设（激活项置顶最前）\n  try {\n    const pSel = document.getElementById('preset-select');\n    if (window.nuo && window.nuo.preset && window.nuo.preset.config) {\n      const cfg = await window.nuo.preset.config({ scope: 'offline' });\n      if (cfg && cfg.presets && cfg.presets.length > 0) {\n        const sortedPresets = [...cfg.presets].sort((a, b) => (b.active ? 1 : 0) - (a.active ? 1 : 0));\n        pSel.innerHTML = sortedPresets.map(p => `\n          <option value=\"${p.name || p.id}\" ${p.active ? 'selected' : ''}>${p.name || p.id} ${p.active ? '(当前激活)' : ''}</option>\n        `).join('');\n        onPresetChange();\n      }\n    }\n  } catch (e) {}\n\n  // 3. 读取世界书设定\n  try {\n    if (window.nuo && window.nuo.worldbook && window.nuo.worldbook.list) {\n      worldbookList = await window.nuo.worldbook.list();\n      const wbSel = document.getElementById('wb-select');\n      wbSel.innerHTML = '<option value=\"\">选择世界书条目...</option>' + \n        (worldbookList || []).map(w => `<option value=\"${w.name || w.title || w.id}\">${w.name || w.title || w.id}</option>`).join('');\n    }\n  } catch (e) {}\n}\n\nfunction onCharChange() {\n  const sel = document.getElementById('char-select');\n  const preview = document.getElementById('char-name-preview');\n  preview.value = sel.options[sel.selectedIndex].text;\n}\n\nfunction onPresetChange() {\n  const sel = document.getElementById('preset-select');\n  document.getElementById('preset-subhint').textContent = `⚡ 已关联线下预设「${sel.options[sel.selectedIndex].text}」（自动注入线下规则）`;\n}\n\nfunction toggleWorldbookSelect() {\n  const wbSel = document.getElementById('wb-select');\n  wbSel.style.display = wbSel.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';\n}\n\nfunction onWorldbookPicked() {\n  const wbSel = document.getElementById('wb-select');\n  if (wbSel.value) {\n    document.getElementById('wb-input').value = wbSel.value;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction showError(msg) {\n  const box = document.getElementById('error-box');\n  if (!box) return;\n  box.style.display = 'block';\n  box.textContent = '❌ 生成出错：\\n' + msg;\n}\n\nfunction clearError() {\n  const box = document.getElementById('error-box');\n  if (!box) return;\n  box.style.display = 'none';\n  box.textContent = '';\n}\n\n// 自动生成高张力暧昧色气版（兼顾过审防截断与色气沉沦）\nfunction generateCleanVersion(charName, charId, themeText, sceneText, poseText) {\n  const tags = ['#私房密录', '#极致拉扯', '#耳边喘息', '#潮红失控', '#反差沉沦', '#欲拒还迎'];\n  return {\n    tag: 'Verified',\n    title: `【私房特写】${charName} 镜头前完全失守的隐秘缠绵 · 喘息与沉沦全记录 [4K独家]`,\n    actor: charName,\n    actorHandle: `${charId || 'lover'}_official`,\n    duration: '38:20',\n    views: '2.4M views',\n    rating: '97%',\n    date: '刚刚拍摄',\n    tags: tags,\n    intro: `在${sceneText || '昏暗私密的房间'}内，被抵在身下的暧昧对峙。滚烫的吐息扫过耳后敏感带，原本紧绷的理智随着游移的触碰彻底崩解，低哑的闷哼与泛红的眼角被镜头毫无保留地全数捕获。`,\n    timeline: [\n      { time: \"00:00\", desc: \"开场昏暗特写：被逼至死角，微乱衣襟与急促起伏的胸膛，眼神慌乱闪躲\" },\n      { time: \"04:10\", desc: \"扣住手腕压于身侧，滚烫吐息贴近耳畔低语，敏感处轻颤泛起大片红晕\" },\n      { time: \"08:35\", desc: \"唇齿深吻纠缠：水声与急促换气声交织，指节深深陷入发丝与后颈\" },\n      { time: \"13:50\", desc: \"衣物半褪特写：凌乱布料下的敏感战栗，难以自抑的断续呜咽与失守求饶\" },\n      { time: \"19:20\", desc: \"镜前反光第一人称：被迫直视镜中完全沉溺情欲的自己，眼尾泛潮、腰肢微弓\" },\n      { time: \"25:40\", desc: \"攻势骤然加剧：完全失去主导权，十指死死抓紧被单，泛着水光的闷哼声变调\" },\n      { time: \"31:15\", desc: \"高潮极致失神：瞳孔彻底涣散，痉挛般紧紧缠住对方不放，失控的哭腔溢出\" },\n      { time: \"36:40\", desc: \"余韵战栗平复：瘫软在怀中不住抽搐轻颤，凌乱汗湿的发丝与耳边低哑安抚